{"version":1,"content":"<p>本月初，仰望U9 Xtreme在阿布扎比跑出503.17km/h，拿下量產車極速世界紀錄！<strong>近日，老牌超跑廠商科尼塞克宣佈，旗下Jesko Absolut仍將發起極速挑戰，目標衝擊330英裏/小時（約532km/h），意圖重新奪回全球量產車極速王冠。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587642.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:13:57.656162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:58:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_hash":"e97ad8f83777ec0b19b272b8ce327f088f24ff0b227bc6dc877c4ff9dae35988","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}